      hu: "Chojnice óvárosa középkori alaprajzáról ismert. Különösen említésre méltók a városfal jól megőrzött részei.",
      ro: "Centrul vechi din Chojnice se remarcă prin planul său medieval. Părțile bine conservate ale zidului orașului sunt deosebit de notabile.",
      en: "Chojnice's Old Town is characterized by its medieval layout. The well-preserved sections of the city wall are particularly noteworthy.",
